{%- comment -%}
  MY TAPE STORE — ABANDONED CHECKOUT  ·  Shopify Email "Custom Liquid" block

  WHERE THIS GOES
  Marketing > Automations > Abandoned checkout > edit the email, then:
    1. delete EVERY other block (logo, heading, text, product grid, button, divider)
    2. keep ONE Custom Liquid block
    3. paste all of this into it
  The footer with the unsubscribe link cannot be deleted and should not be —
  it is legally required. Everything above it is now yours.

  WHY THIS IS DARK ON PURPOSE
  A Custom Liquid block cannot reach the document head, so there is no way to declare
  color-scheme or add a dark-mode media query. Gmail on Android force-inverts
  light emails and ignores every opt-out — that is what produced the muddy
  result you saw. It leaves genuinely dark emails alone. Building on the brand's
  own charcoal (#1f1f1f, the same ground as the site header and footer) means
  the email renders identically in every client instead of being re-coloured by
  one of them.

  Every colour below is measured against WCAG on the surface it sits on:
    #ffffff on #1f1f1f  16.5:1     #c9c6c1 on #1f1f1f  9.7:1
    #9c9893 on #1f1f1f   5.8:1     #fa3c22 on #1f1f1f  4.5:1
  Button text is 18px bold so white on #df3c22 (4.37:1) clears the large-text bar.

  VARIABLE NAMES — CHECK THE PREVIEW
  Shopify Email exposes a limited Liquid scope. If a value renders blank, try the
  bare form without the `checkout.` prefix. The cart link is the one that must work.
{%- endcomment -%}

<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
       style="background:#1f1f1f;margin:0;padding:0;">
  <tr><td align="center" style="padding:0;">

    <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
           style="width:600px;max-width:600px;background:#1f1f1f;">

      <!-- hazard stripe -->
      <tr><td style="height:6px;line-height:6px;font-size:0;
          background:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,#df3c22 0 14px,#8c2612 14px 28px);">&nbsp;</td></tr>

      <!-- logo: the LIGHT variant, or "mytape" disappears on charcoal -->
      <tr><td align="center" style="padding:30px 32px 0 32px;">
        <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0783/2017/3161/files/mytapestore-email-logo-light-793.png"
             alt="{{ shop.name }}" width="190" height="33"
             style="display:block;width:190px;height:33px;border:0;outline:none;">
      </td></tr>

      <!-- headline -->
      <tr><td style="padding:26px 32px 0 32px;font-family:'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
        <div style="display:inline-block;background:#3a2621;color:#ff8264;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;
             letter-spacing:1.3px;text-transform:uppercase;padding:6px 11px;border-radius:6px;">
          Still in your cart
        </div>
        <h1 style="margin:16px 0 0 0;font-size:27px;line-height:1.22;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;
            letter-spacing:-0.5px;">
          You left something behind{% if customer.first_name %}, {{ customer.first_name }}{% endif %}.
        </h1>
        <p style="margin:11px 0 0 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#c9c6c1;">
          Your cart is saved and ready to go — pick up exactly where you left off.
        </p>
      </td></tr>

      <!-- CTA. 18px bold so the white-on-brand-red contrast clears WCAG large text. -->
      <tr><td style="padding:24px 32px 0 32px;">
        <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr>
          <td style="background:#df3c22;border-radius:7px;">
            <a href="{{ checkout.abandoned_checkout_url | default: abandoned_checkout_url }}"
               style="display:inline-block;padding:15px 32px;font-family:'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;
                      font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0.2px;">
              Return to my cart
            </a>
          </td>
        </tr></table>
      </td></tr>

      <!-- what's waiting -->
      <tr><td style="padding:30px 32px 0 32px;font-family:'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
        <div style="border-top:1px solid #3a3a3a;padding-top:20px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;
             letter-spacing:1.4px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#9c9893;">
          What's waiting
        </div>
      </td></tr>

      {% for line in checkout.line_items %}
      <tr><td style="padding:16px 32px 0 32px;font-family:'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
        <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr>
          <td width="72" valign="top" style="padding-right:16px;">
            {% if line.image %}
              <img src="{{ line.image | img_url: '144x144' }}" alt="" width="72" height="72"
                   style="display:block;width:72px;height:72px;border-radius:8px;background:#ffffff;">
            {% else %}
              <div style="width:72px;height:72px;border-radius:8px;background:#2b2b2b;">&nbsp;</div>
            {% endif %}
          </td>
          <td valign="middle" style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;">
            <div style="font-weight:600;color:#ffffff;font-size:15px;">{{ line.title }}</div>
            {% if line.variant.title and line.variant.title != 'Default Title' %}
              <div style="color:#9c9893;font-size:13px;margin-top:3px;">{{ line.variant.title }}</div>
            {% endif %}
            <div style="color:#c9c6c1;font-size:13px;margin-top:3px;">Qty {{ line.quantity }}</div>
          </td>
        </tr></table>
      </td></tr>
      {% endfor %}

      <!-- bulk pricing: the real reason to come back -->
      <tr><td style="padding:26px 32px 0 32px;">
        <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
               style="background:#2b2b2b;border-radius:10px;">
          <tr><td style="padding:18px 20px;font-family:'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
            <div style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#ffffff;">Buying more than one? It gets cheaper.</div>
            <div style="font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#c9c6c1;margin-top:6px;">
              Volume pricing applies automatically at checkout — no code needed. Most of our range steps down
              <strong style="color:#ff8264;">5%</strong> from 2 units,
              <strong style="color:#ff8264;">10%</strong> from 6, and
              <strong style="color:#ff8264;">15%</strong> from 10.
            </div>
          </td></tr>
        </table>
      </td></tr>

      <!-- help -->
      <tr><td style="padding:26px 32px 34px 32px;font-family:'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
        <div style="border-top:1px solid #3a3a3a;padding-top:20px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;color:#c9c6c1;">
          Not sure which tape suits the job? Call us on
          <a href="tel:+61340616287" style="color:#ff8264;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;">+61 3 4061 6287</a>
          — we're happy to help.
        </div>
      </td></tr>

      <tr><td style="height:6px;line-height:6px;font-size:0;
          background:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,#df3c22 0 14px,#8c2612 14px 28px);">&nbsp;</td></tr>

    </table>
  </td></tr>
</table>
